0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"清楚的目標就像（　），能幫助我們在迷惘時找到方向。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"儘管這項作業複雜，但為了小組榮譽，他（　）擔任組長。","n":26,"ssz":"..........1..............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比賽結束後，他低著頭（　）的說：「下次一定要贏。」","n":25,"ssz":"...................1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對挑戰時，與其（　）、放棄，不如先找出問題所在。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對失敗時，不同的（　）會影響是否願意再努力。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分組討論是練習表達想法的（　），不應該只是沉默旁聽。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學會控制情緒不太可能（　），但每次覺察都是進步。","n":24,"ssz":"......1................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他在球場上很有自信，回到課堂卻表現得死氣沉沉，真是（　）。","n":29,"ssz":".................1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項中「  」的語詞，何者使用正確？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他經常「義無反顧」，說話不算話，不可以輕易相信他的承諾","n":27,"ssz":"............1........1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在這場競爭激烈的比賽中，他「一步到位」，率先衝過終點線","n":27,"ssz":"..............1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這次的選拔比賽會有許多球探來觀賽，你可別錯失「良機」了","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他鼓起勇氣「喃喃」唸出告白信，結果讓整個走廊都聽見了","n":26,"ssz":"...................1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第五段，作者將固定型思維比喻成大腦進入「省電模式」，以下何者最符合固定型思維的特色？","n":44,"ssz":"............................................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會主動尋找更困難的任務，讓自己持續進步","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會避免挑戰與風險，讓自己待在安全範圍內","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會快速分析失敗原因，找出下一步練習方向","n":19,"ssz":".............1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會把別人的成功看成榜樣，進一步模仿學習","n":19,"ssz":".............1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第六段，作者提到棒球是「高失敗率的運動」，即使優秀打者也常常失敗。作者舉這個例子，最主要是為了說明什麼？","n":54,"ssz":".......................................1.1.....1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"棒球選手之所以成功，是因為比一般人天分更高","n":21,"ssz":"............1.2......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"棒球比數學更困難，所以更適合用來練習抗壓","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要選擇失敗率高的活動，就能自然培養信心","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"優秀的人也會失敗，重點是如何從失敗中調整","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列何者最符合文章主旨？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對失敗時，改變解釋方式，能幫助自己找出下一步","n":23,"ssz":".....................1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生在教室裡容易放棄，主要是因為缺少足夠的興趣","n":23,"ssz":"...............1.....1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成功者之所以能成功，是因為他們具有良好天賦","n":21,"ssz":"............1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每個人都應該多多運動，才能改變原本的學習能力","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列何者的思維最具成長型思維的特質？","n":18,"ssz":"..........1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小荷：「每個人天生就有擅長與不擅長的事情，不用過分執著。」","n":29,"ssz":".....1........1......1....4.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿玖：「避免失敗、避免犯錯，才是追求成功的最高原則。」","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"奇奇：「遇到問題或挫折，不代表做不到，只是還需要找方法。」","n":29,"ssz":"............1...1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"方仔：「人生的追逐無窮無盡，練習知足才能帶來真正的快樂。」","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（四☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第一種──固定型思維：覺得聰明是天生的，「我沒有","n":24,"ssz":"............1..........."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成長型思維和固定型思維有什麼不同？兩種思維都可能出現在我們心裡。請先看下面的比較，再完成後面的練習。","n":50,"ssz":".1...1............................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比較項目","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"固定型思維","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"基本想法","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能力可以透過練習進步。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能力是天生的，很難改變。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對挑戰","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"困難代表我有機會練習。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"困難代表我做不到、不適合。","n":13,"ssz":"......1..1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對失敗","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失敗提醒我哪裡需要調整。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失敗讓我丟臉，想藏起來。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[3][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到別人成功","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想知道他用了什麼方法。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"覺得自己被比下去了。","n":10,"ssz":".1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[4][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內心對話","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[4][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我想再試一次！」","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[4][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我就知道我不行。」","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習一","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習一：請閱讀下列情境中的「腦中想法」，完成兩件事：\n判斷這句話比較像「固定型思維」還是「成長型思維」。\n想一想：如果我相信這句話，我接下來比較可能會怎麼做？","n":80,"ssz":"...............................................1.............1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習一：請閱讀下列情境中的「腦中想法」，完成兩件事：","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"判斷這句話比較像「固定型思維」還是「成長型思維」。","n":25,"ssz":"...................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想一想：如果我相信這句話，我接下來比較可能會怎麼做？","n":26,"ssz":".......1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"數學題寫錯，我想：「我數學就不好。」","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"思維類型","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].items[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果我相信這句話，我可能會……","n":15,"ssz":"...1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"英文太難，我想：「反正我再努力也不會更好。」","n":22,"ssz":"................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到同學很快解出題目，我想：「他是怎麼做到的？我可以學他的第一步。」","n":34,"ssz":".................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比賽失分後，我想：「可能是策略被對方抓到了，我可以和隊友討論。」","n":32,"ssz":".........................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"考差之後，我想：「我就知道我不行，以後不要再碰這種題目了。」","n":30,"ssz":"...................1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→你觀察到了嗎？固定型思維通常讓我們停下來、躲起來；成長型思維通常讓我們調整、求助、再試一次。而怎麼看待思考會影響我們的下一步。","n":64,"ssz":"...........................1.................................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習二","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習二：加入「Not yet」精神──\n成長型思維中，面對挑戰，會把「我不會」變成「我還不會」；把「我做不到」變成「我還沒找到方法」。每個人都會有固定型的想法，而當這樣的想法出現時，我們可以先看見它、理解它，試著加入「Not yet」精神，幫助自己找出下一步。","n":131,"ssz":"......................1..............1.......1.......1...............1..........................................................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎練習二：加入「Not yet」精神──","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成長型思維中，面對挑戰，會把「我不會」變成「我還不會」；把「我做不到」變成「我還沒找到方法」。每個人都會有固定型的想法，而當這樣的想法出現時，我們可以先看見它、理解它，試著加入「Not yet」精神，幫助自己找出下一步。","n":110,"ssz":".1..............1.......1.......1...............1..........................................................1.."